  "job_B15.8.631_20260920_210346": {
    "text": "\u00d0is synd \u00fea land gem\u00e6ru to wulfringe Lyem tune.\n\u00c6rest of lus\u00feorne in hwitan dene.\nOf hwitan dene in yrfe, of yrfe \u00fe\u00e6t cym\u00f0 into baldrices gem\u00e6ran in \u00fe\u00e6t fulgeri\u00f0.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6m fulgeri\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t cyme\u00f0 in \u00fe\u00e6t heafod land, of \u00feam heafodlonde \u00fe\u00e6t sceot spers ofer \u00feone\nOf \u00feam portwege in \u00f0a dene, of \u00fe\u00e6re dene up big \u00fe\u00e6m fearne.\nFrom \u00feam fearne to nor\u00f0 dic, ondlong \u00fe\u00e6re dic to cowwan ege.\nOf cowwan ege healf brada mor to fn\u00e6tes wyllan, of fn\u00e6tes wyllan \u00fe\u00e6t cyme\u00f0 to rommes dene.\nOndlong rommes dene \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00fe\u00e6re str\u00e6te, ondlong \u00fe\u00e6re str\u00e6te \u00fe\u00e6t cyme\u00f0 to oswaldes hlawe.\nOf oswaldes hlawe ondlong \u00fe\u00e6re sealt str\u00e6t to fulan mere.\nOf fulan mere eft in lus\u00feorn.\n\u00d0is syndon \u00fea land gem\u00e6ru to wulfering tune.\nOf wudu for brycge up andlang byrn wynne dene, of byrnwynne dene up to \u00feam salt pytte.\nOf \u00feam sealtpytte ondlang dene, of \u00fe\u00e6re dene andlang pytten to \u00fe\u00e6re sealtstr\u00e6te.\nSwa for\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6re fyrran dic, andlang \u00fe\u00e6re dice innan salt broc.\nAndlang saltbroce innan hymel broc, andlang hymel broces healf stream to byrnwynne dene.",
